WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.410 --> 00:00:04.830
Okay, let's address something head on just
to do it and get it out of the way for future

00:00:04.830 --> 00:00:10.769
segments last week and in other segments,
I've made an effort to remind the audience

00:00:10.769 --> 00:00:16.560
that I'm completely fine covering instances
of right wing violence based on politics,

00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:18.340
end of left wing political violence.

00:00:18.340 --> 00:00:22.880
And that we shouldn't be hypocrites, we shouldn't
hide left wing violence to the extent that

00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:27.849
it exists, but when I do those stories, I
will remind you that it's important to remember

00:00:27.849 --> 00:00:31.750
that most politically oriented violence in
the United States is right wing.

00:00:31.750 --> 00:00:37.690
It's important to remind you of that, not
for some kind of what about ism, but because

00:00:37.690 --> 00:00:42.870
if we really want to deal with the issue of
political violence as an apparatus in the

00:00:42.870 --> 00:00:49.149
United States as a problem, we have to understand
where it comes from and it mostly comes from

00:00:49.149 --> 00:00:50.340
the right.

00:00:50.340 --> 00:00:56.379
Most religious violence in the United States
is from right-wingers, so let's actually dig

00:00:56.379 --> 00:00:57.379
into that.

00:00:57.379 --> 00:01:02.010
And the way we know things is through studying
data and there are countless ways that you

00:01:02.010 --> 00:01:03.590
can come to the same conclusion.

00:01:03.590 --> 00:01:05.440
So let's go through some of the sources.

00:01:05.440 --> 00:01:09.680
I'm sure many of you will have problems with
some of these sources, which is why I'm presenting

00:01:09.680 --> 00:01:10.690
a number of different ones.

00:01:10.690 --> 00:01:12.370
Let's start with the anti-defamation league.

00:01:12.370 --> 00:01:16.250
The Anti Defamation League has studied this
for a very long time.

00:01:16.250 --> 00:01:21.440
Their latest report is from 2018 which makes
sense since we're in 2019 right now and it

00:01:21.440 --> 00:01:24.010
is on domestic extremist murder.

00:01:24.010 --> 00:01:30.830
50 of 50 people killed in 2018 we're because
of right wing extremism.

00:01:30.830 --> 00:01:40.710
78% were white supremacists, 16% were anti-government
extremists, 4% were in cell extremists and

00:01:40.710 --> 00:01:44.820
2% meaning one guy was an Islamist extremist.

00:01:44.820 --> 00:01:48.860
Now we can argue over whether Islamist extremism
is left or right wing.

00:01:48.860 --> 00:01:54.120
The right loves to say Islamist extremism
is left wing because Muslims I guess often

00:01:54.120 --> 00:01:55.620
don't like Republicans.

00:01:55.620 --> 00:02:00.830
This is extraordinarily simplistic and shortsighted
religious belief to a degree that you become

00:02:00.830 --> 00:02:06.040
radicalized, uh, is by nature a right wing
perversion of religion.

00:02:06.040 --> 00:02:11.720
But we can ignore it and we can say 49 of
50, 2018 domestic extremist murders.

00:02:11.720 --> 00:02:13.910
We're definitely right wing extremists.

00:02:13.910 --> 00:02:14.910
One out of 50.

00:02:14.910 --> 00:02:19.360
I guess we can debate, uh, uh, the, the specifics
of it, that's the anti-defamation league.

00:02:19.360 --> 00:02:23.460
Now I know some of you disliked the ADL or
you don't trust the ADL.

00:02:23.460 --> 00:02:25.360
So let's go to another set of data.

00:02:25.360 --> 00:02:30.070
This CSI s the Center for Strategic and International
Studies.

00:02:30.070 --> 00:02:36.140
They've identified that indeed the overwhelming
majority of violence from extremists in the

00:02:36.140 --> 00:02:42.250
United States is coming from white supremacists
and high government extremists, including

00:02:42.250 --> 00:02:46.190
militias and so-called sovereign citizens
groups.

00:02:46.190 --> 00:02:48.920
Very, very clear on the data.

00:02:48.920 --> 00:02:52.210
Some of you will say, David, I don't like
the ADL and I don't like CSI.

00:02:52.210 --> 00:02:57.670
Yes, well then you've got the data from the
Center for investigative reporting who also

00:02:57.670 --> 00:03:07.040
looked at this from 2008 to 2016 and they
found 115 right wing terror incidents, 63

00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:10.970
Islamist inspired terror incidents and 19
